    <exercise>
        <title>Momentum</title>
        <statement>
            <p>
            Note: the novelty in many of these problems is that the motion now involves several stages. 
            So now your <q>careful drawing</q> should be the important frames from the movie depicting this motion. 
            Note also that when motion comes in several stages, these different stages may be best approached or 
            solved in different ways. 
